hadiths[7]{hadithnumber,text}:
"192","[AI-translation] Hamein Abu Bakr Muhammad bin Aban ne hadith sunai, unhon ne kaha: Hamein Waki' ne hadith sunai, Hisham ad-Dastuwa'i se, Budeel bin Maysarah al-Uqaili se, Abdullah bin Ubaid bin Umair se, Umm-e-Kulthum se, Aisha se. Unhon ne kaha: Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam chhah (6) ashab ke sath aik khana khaya karte the, pas aik A'rabi aaya aur usne do luqmon mein wo kha gaya, to Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Agar wo tasmiya padhta to tumhare liye kafi ho jata."
"193","[AI-translation] Hamein Hannad aur Mahmud bin Ghailan ne hadith sunai, donon ne kaha: Hamein Abu Usama ne hadith sunai, Zakariya bin Abi Za'idah se, Sa'id bin Abi Burdah se, Anas bin Malik se. Unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ta'ala banday se is tarah razaa farmata hai ke wo aik luqma khaye ya aik ghoont piye, phir us par Allah ki hamd kare."
"194","[AI-translation] Hamein Husain bin Aswad Baghdadi ne hadith sunai, unhon ne kaha: Hamein Amr bin Muhammad ne hadith sunai, unhon ne kaha: Hamein Isa bin Tahman ne hadith sunai, Thabit se. Unhon ne kaha: Anas bin Malik ne hamare paas aik mota lakdi ka pyala, jis par lohe ki patti lagi thi, nikal kar diya, aur kaha: Aey Thabit! Ye Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ka pyala hai."
"195","[AI-translation] Hamein Abdullah bin Abdur-Rahman ne hadith sunai, unhon ne kaha: Hamein Amr bin Asim ne khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Hamein Hammad bin Salmah ne khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Hamein Humaid aur Thabit ne khabar di, Anas se. Unhon ne kaha: Be-shak, main ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko is pyalay mein har qisam ka sharab pila hai: pani, nabeeth, shehad aur doodh."
"196","[AI-translation] Hamein Ismail bin Musa Fazari ne hadith sunai, unhon ne kaha: Hamein Ibrahim bin Sa'd ne hadith sunai, apne walid se, Abdullah se. Unhon ne kaha: Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam tar khajoor ke sath kheera khaya karte the."
"197","[AI-translation] Hamay hadith suna'i 'Abdah bin 'Abdillah Al-Khuza'i Al-Basri ne, unhon ne kaha: Hamay hadith suna'i Mu'awiyah bin Hisham ne, Sufyan se, Hisham bin 'Urwah se, un ke walid se, 'Aishah se: Ke Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam tarbooz ko ratab ke sath khaya karte the."
"198","[AI-translation] Hamay hadith suna'i Ibrahim bin Ya'qub ne, unhon ne kaha: Hamay hadith suna'i Wahb bin Jarir ne, unhon ne kaha: Hamay hadith suna'i mere walid ne, unhon ne kaha: Maine Humaid ko suna, ya unhon ne kaha: Mujhe Humaid ne hadith suna'i, Wahb ne kaha: aur wo un ka dost tha, Anas bin Malik se, unhon ne kaha: Maine Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko kharbeza aur ratab ko ek sath jam karte hue dekha."
